This license ensures that the Work and any of its structural derivatives remain permanently un-weaponized, localized, and dedicated exclusively to humane, non-offensive artistic, educational, or defensive protective use.

1. PERMITTED USES (ARTISTIC, RESEARCH, AND OPEN VERIFICATION)

You are permitted to:
• Study and Extend: Analyze, extend, modify, and integrate the conceptual geometry, array layouts, and manifold transformations into your own codebases.
• Build Creative Infrastructure: Incorporate the five primitives (Tessellation Bees, Manifold Goats, Meadow Pedagogy, Mandala Cognition, Co-Created Worlds) into interactive graphics engines, local canvases, user interfaces, or digital art installations.
• Compile and Verify: Run local numerical checks, coordinate tests, and formal verification scripts (utilizing Lean 4, Coq, or pytest frameworks) to check stroke limits and metric invariants at compile time.
• Share and Publish: Distribute modified versions or research preprints based on the parent geometry, provided that all attribution, non-dual-use restrictions, and structural disclosures remain completely intact.

2. PROHIBITED USES (DUAL‑USE INTERCEPTOR SAFEGUARD)

The Work and any of its derivatives or structural lineage may not be packaged, modified, sold, or deployed for any offensive, military, kinetic, or strike-path optimization applications. Prohibited use cases include, but are not limited to:
• Offensive Strike Mapping: Utilizing the high-dimensional tracking matrix or alternative sector calculations to locate cracks or spatial gaps in an adversary's defensive field.
• Autonomous Strike Systems: Real-time kinetic optimization, hyper-adversarial trajectory planning, or launch-vector coordination for autonomous weapons arrays or drone swarms.
• Surveillance and Enclosure: Algorithms deployed to restrict legal personhood, automate cross-border administrative behavioral tracking, or violate human rights monitoring frameworks.
• Regulatory Non-Compliance: Any operational architecture that breaches international arms-control treaties, dual-use export-control frameworks (such as the Wassenaar Arrangement or Missile Technology Control Regime), or European Union artificial intelligence safety and grid-stability mandates.

2.1 DEFENSIVE INTERCEPTION CLAUSE (CIVILIAN INFRASTRUCTURE SAFEGUARD)

Notwithstanding the prohibitions outlined in Section 2, the unique mathematical primitives of this architecture—specifically the high-dimensional Riemannian state tracking and continuous differential connection fields—may be compiled and executed within operational engineering environments if and only if the system is deployed exclusively as a purely passive, non-offensive defensive interceptor mechanism.
Permitted defensive applications are strictly limited to the following operational parameters:
• Protection of Civilian Infrastructure: Shielding non-military energy grids, hospitals, transport networks, and public digital communication sectors from incoming kinetic or structural threats.
• Absolute Entropic Neutrality: Predicting tracking-matrix drift and stabilizing atmospheric boundaries to neutralize incoming vector hazards without creating spatial gaps, offensive trajectory paths, or hyper-adversarial kinetic optimization.
• Erga Omnes Enforcement: Operating purely as a structural shield to preserve truth, baseline safety coordinates, and human life, in compliance with universal humanitarian design principles.
Any deployment of this framework to optimize offensive trajectories or plan hyper-velocity strikes accelerates systemic entropy and constitutes a complete, immediate violation of this license.

